                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Feature Grid -->
    <section id="features" class="features">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Everything You Need for Clean Books</h2>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Automated Reconciliation</h3>
                    <p>We connect securely with your bank and credit card accounts to sync and match transactions daily.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Dedicated Bookkeeper</h3>
                    <p>Get a assigned certified expert who understands your industry and answers your questions directly.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Invoicing & AR Tracking</h3>
                    <p>Send professional invoices, track unpaid balances, and automate payment reminders effortless.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Expense Categorization</h3>
                    <p>Smart rules classify every purchase correctly, ensuring you maximize allowable tax write-offs.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Monthly Financial Statements</h3>
                    <p>Receive clear Balance Sheets, Income Statements, and Cash Flow summaries by the 5th of every month.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Seamless Software Sync</h3>
                    <p>Integration support for QuickBooks, Xero, Stripe, PayPal, Shopify, and major payroll platforms.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pricing Tiers -->
    <section id="pricing" class="pricing">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Simple, Transparent Pricing</h2>
            <p style="text-align: center;">No hidden setup fees. Upgrade or cancel anytime.</p>
            
            <div class="pricing-grid">
                <!-- Starter Tier -->
                <div class="pricing-card">
                    <h3>Starter</h3>
                    <p>Ideal for solo entrepreneurs and freelancers.</p>
                    <div class="price">$149 <span>/month</span></div>
                    <ul class="pricing-features">
                        <li>Up to $15k monthly expenses</li>
