                    <p>Perfect for scaling small businesses and teams.</p>
                    <div class="price">$299 <span>/month</span></div>
                    <ul class="pricing-features">
                        <li>Up to $50k monthly expenses</li>
                        <li>Dedicated lead bookkeeper</li>
                        <li>Monthly & quarterly statements</li>
                        <li>Tax planning assistance</li>
                        <li>Priority chat & phone support</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-primary">Start 14-Day Free Trial</a>
                </div>

                <!-- Scale Tier -->
                <div class="pricing-card">
                    <h3>Pro Scale</h3>
                    <p>Designed for high-volume, complex businesses.</p>
                    <div class="price">$499 <span>/month</span></div>
                    <ul class="pricing-features">
                        <li>Up to $100k+ monthly expenses</li>
                        <li>Senior bookkeeping team</li>
                        <li>Custom financial reporting</li>
                        <li>Invoicing & bill pay support</li>
                        <li>Dedicated Account Manager</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-secondary">Contact Sales</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Testimonials -->
    <section id="testimonials" class="testimonials">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Trusted by Business Owners</h2>
            <div class="testimonial-grid">
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <p class="testimonial-text">"LedgerKeeper completely transformed how I run my agency. I saved over 15 hours during last month's tax preparation alone. Worth every penny!"</p>
                    <div class="author-info">
                        <h4>Sarah Jenkins</h4>
                        <p>Founder, Apex Marketing</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <p class="testimonial-text">"Having a dedicated team keeping my books balanced daily gives me total peace of mind. The financial reporting is super easy to read."</p>
                    <div class="author-info">
                        <h4>Marcus Vance</h4>
                        <p>CEO, Vance Logistics</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Email Signup / Call to Action -->
    <section id="signup" class="cta-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Ready to Simplify Your Finances?</h2>
            <p>Join hundreds of business owners who trust LedgerKeeper with their books. Get started with a free 14-day trial today.</p>
            
            <form class="cta-form" onsubmit="handleFormSubmit(event)">
                <input type="email" id="user-email" placeholder="Enter your business email" required>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started Now</button>
            </form>
            <p id="form-message" style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #a7f3d0; display: none;"></p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container footer-container">
            <p>&copy; 2026 LedgerKeeper Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Created by: <a href="mailto:serahk360@gmail.com">serahk360@gmail.com</a></p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- Form Handling Script -->
    <script>
        function handleFormSubmit(event) {
            event.preventDefault();
            const emailInput = document.getElementById('user-email');
            const messageElement = document.getElementById('form-message');
            
            if (emailInput.value) {
                messageElement.innerText = "Thank you! We'll reach out to " + emailInput.value + " shortly.";
                messageElement.style.display = "block";
                emailInput.value = "";
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
